invariant: INV-14
file: src/srv.c
catches: srv_auth_test
reason: a server takes a ticket_key_previous of all zero bytes, so anyone
  seals a ticket that opens under it and resumes as this server.
  test/srv_identity_tests.h's test_previous_ticket_key requires CH_EINVAL
  for it before any I/O (docs/decisions.md 220).

--- old
    return ticket_key_own(srv->ticket_key_previous, srv->cookie_key) &&
--- new
    return !ct_memeq(srv->ticket_key_previous, srv->cookie_key, CH_SRV_TICKET_KEY_LEN) &&
